<title>FINLAND: HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT OR LOWER AT FIX.</title>
<headline>HELIBOR INTEREST RATES FLAT OR LOWER AT FIX.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Helibor interest rates were</p>
<p>lower or flat at the Bank of Finland's daily fixing on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The three-month rate fell one b.p. to 3.07 percent.</p>
<p>			   April 8 fix	   April 7 fix</p>
<p> 1-mth Helibor	    3.00 pct		3.01 pct</p>
<p> 2-mth Helibor	    3.04 pct		3.04 pct</p>
<p> 3-mth Helibor	    3.07 pct		3.08 pct</p>
<p> 6-mth Helibor	    3.22 pct		3.23 pct</p>
<p> 9-mth Helibor	    3.38 pct		3.39 pct</p>
<p> 12-mth Helibor	   3.52 pct		3.55 pct</p>
<p>-- Helsinki Newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
